        "accessibilityText": "CANONICAL REQUIREMENTS\n\nAccessibility contract\nRun component QA →\nNATIVE SEMANTICS\n\nExpose structured locale-aware segments, grids, or channels rather than display-string identity.\n\nKEYBOARD\n\nTab, Shift+Tab, ArrowDown, ArrowUp, ArrowLeft, ArrowRight, Home, End, PageUp, PageDown, Enter, Escape\n\nFOCUS\n\nSegment Focus, Grid Focus Repair, Restore Focus\n\nWCAG REFERENCES\n\n1.3.1, 2.1.1, 2.4.3, 2.4.7, 3.3.1, 3.3.2, 4.1.2, 4.1.3\n\nThese requirements come from the canonical Date Picker catalog entry. Application copy, labels, custom styling, and composed workflows still require product-level testing.",
        "usageCode": "import {\n  DatePickerRoot,\n  DatePickerLabel,\n  DatePickerInput,\n  DatePickerSegment,\n  DatePickerTrigger,\n  DatePickerPositioner,\n  DatePickerContent,\n  DatePickerHeader,\n  DatePickerPrevious,\n  DatePickerNext,\n  DatePickerGrid,\n  DatePickerGridLabel,\n  DatePickerCell,\n  DatePickerCellTrigger,\n  DatePickerHiddenInput,\n} from '@uifn/components-react/date-picker'\nimport '@uifn/components/styles.css'\n\nexport function Example() {\n  return (\n    <DatePickerRoot defaultValue={{\"year\":2026,\"month\":7,\"day\":22}} locale=\"en-US\" timeZone=\"UTC\" name=\"due-date\">\n      <DatePickerLabel>Due date</DatePickerLabel>\n      <DatePickerInput>\n        <DatePickerSegment value=\"month\">07</DatePickerSegment>\n        <DatePickerSegment value=\"day\">22</DatePickerSegment>\n        <DatePickerSegment value=\"year\">2026</DatePickerSegment>\n      </DatePickerInput>\n      <DatePickerTrigger type=\"button\">Open calendar</DatePickerTrigger>\n      <DatePickerPositioner>\n        <DatePickerContent>\n          <DatePickerHeader>\n            <DatePickerPrevious type=\"button\">Previous month</DatePickerPrevious>\n            <DatePickerNext type=\"button\">Next month</DatePickerNext>\n          </DatePickerHeader>\n          <DatePickerGrid>\n            <DatePickerGridLabel>July 2026</DatePickerGridLabel>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <DatePickerCell value=\"2026-07-19\">\n                  <DatePickerCellTrigger type=\"button\" value=\"2026-07-19\">19</DatePickerCellTrigger>\n                </DatePickerCell>\n                <DatePickerCell value=\"2026-07-20\">\n                  <DatePickerCellTrigger type=\"button\" value=\"2026-07-20\">20</DatePickerCellTrigger>\n                </DatePickerCell>\n                <DatePickerCell value=\"2026-07-21\">\n                  <DatePickerCellTrigger type=\"button\" value=\"2026-07-21\">21</DatePickerCellTrigger>\n                </DatePickerCell>\n                <DatePickerCell value=\"2026-07-22\">\n                  <DatePickerCellTrigger type=\"button\" value=\"2026-07-22\">22</DatePickerCellTrigger>\n                </DatePickerCell>\n                <DatePickerCell value=\"2026-07-23\">\n                  <DatePickerCellTrigger type=\"button\" value=\"2026-07-23\">23</DatePickerCellTrigger>\n                </DatePickerCell>\n                <DatePickerCell value=\"2026-07-24\">\n                  <DatePickerCellTrigger type=\"button\" value=\"2026-07-24\">24</DatePickerCellTrigger>\n                </DatePickerCell>\n                <DatePickerCell value=\"2026-07-25\">\n                  <DatePickerCellTrigger type=\"button\" value=\"2026-07-25\">25</DatePickerCellTrigger>\n                </DatePickerCell>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </DatePickerGrid>\n        </DatePickerContent>\n      </DatePickerPositioner>\n      <DatePickerHiddenInput />\n    </DatePickerRoot>\n  )\n}"
